# rag/.env — API keys for the news/social tools. Copy this file to `rag/.env`
# (which is gitignored) and fill in any keys you have.
#
# All PRIMARY sources work with NO key at all: Yahoo Finance RSS, Google News
# (which carries Reuters / Bloomberg / AP coverage), GDELT, and StockTwits. The
# key below only ADDS a source / raises a limit; the router falls back to the
# keyless sources whenever it is missing or rate-limited.
#
# WARNING: never set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY in this file. The RAG server authenticates
# through the Claude Code login session (Max), and a key in the environment
# breaks that path.

# Finnhub company-news + news-sentiment, free tier ~60 req/min.
# Get one free at https://finnhub.io/register
FINNHUB_API_KEY=
